# 2. PLATFORM IA OVERVIEW

## 2.1 High-Level Platform Map

```
+----------------------------------------------------------+
|                      VYAPARNET PLATFORM                   |
+----------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                           |
|  +-------------+  +-------------+  +-----------------+ |
|  |   BUYER     |  |  SUPPLIER   |  |    OPERATOR      | |
|  |    PWA      |  |   PORTAL    |  |   DASHBOARD      | |
|  |             |  |             |  |                  | |
|  | Mobile-     |  | Lite Web    |  | Task-Based       | |
|  | First Web   |  | App         |  | Mobile-Friendly  | |
|  +-------------+  +-------------+  +-----------------+ |
|                                                           |
|  +-----------------------------------------------------+ |
|  |              ADMIN DASHBOARD                        | |
|  |           (Web, Desktop-Optimized)                   | |
|  +-----------------------------------------------------+ |
|                                                           |
+----------------------------------------------------------+
```

## 2.2 Navigation Principles

### Global Navigation (Available Everywhere)

**For Buyer:**
```
[Home] [Search] [Orders] [Support]
```

**For Supplier:**
```
[Orders] [Stock] [Payments] [Profile]
```

**For Operator:**
```
[Tasks] [QC] [Dispatch] [Profile]
```

**For Admin:**
```
[Overview] [Orders] [Buyers] [Suppliers] [Catalog] [Finance] [Settings]
```

### Segment Switching (If Multi-Business)

```
Current: Textile Business
[Switch to Spare Parts Business]
```

**Rule:** Segment switch resets home/dashboard but keeps session.

