## 3.1 Core Buyer Personas

| Persona | Description | Primary Need |
|---|---|---|
| Textile Retailer | Sells fabric, sarees, kurtis | New designs, MOQ deals, seasonal stock |
| Spare Parts Retailer | Sells 2W/4W parts | Fast-moving consumables, vehicle compatibility |
| Mechanic | Repairs vehicles | Urgent parts, reliable delivery, best price |
| Reseller | Buys bulk for retail | Competitive pricing, bulk deals, variety |

