# 7. USER FLOW ARCHITECTURE

## 7.1 First-Time Buyer Flow

```
Open VyaparNet
|
+-- Phone Number Input
|   +-- OTP Verification
|
+-- Onboarding
|   +-- Business Type Selection
|   |   +-- Retailer
|   |   +-- Mechanic
|   |   +-- Reseller
|   |   +-- Other
|   |
|   +-- Segment Selection
|   |   +-- Textile / Garments
|   |   +-- Spare Parts
|   |   +-- Both (rare initially)
|   |
|   +-- Shop Name
|   +-- Location (City/Pincode)
|   +-- WhatsApp Number (optional)
|   +-- GST (optional - prompt later)
|
+-- Welcome Screen
|   +-- "Aap VyaparNet par swagat hain!"
|   +-- How to order
|   +-- Support info
|
+-- Home Dashboard
```

## 7.2 Returning Buyer Flow

```
Open VyaparNet
|
+-- Auto-login (Token valid)
|
+-- Home Dashboard
|   |
|   +-- [Search / Browse / Quick Reorder]
|   |
|   +-- Search
|   |   +-- Enter product name / part number / design code
|   |   +-- Search results
|   |   +-- Select product
|   |   +-- [Request Quote] or [Add to Order]
|   |
|   +-- Browse Categories
|   |   +-- Select category
|   |   +-- Filter / Sort
|   |   +-- Select product
|   |   +-- [Request Quote] or [Add to Order]
|   |
|   +-- Quick Reorder
|       +-- Select previous order
|       +-- [Reorder Now]
|       +-- Confirm quantity / address
|       +-- Submit
```

## 7.3 Order-to-Delivery Flow

```
Buyer places order
|
+-- System checks availability
+-- Price confirmed
+-- Buyer confirms order
+-- Procurement task created
+-- Operator / supplier confirms stock
+-- Price locked
+-- QC task created (if applicable)
+-- Operator uploads QC proof
+-- Packing / Dispatch proof uploaded
+-- Shipment tracking updated
+-- Delivery completed
+-- Buyer confirms acceptance
+-- Order closed / payment settled
```

## 7.4 Exception Flow

```
Buyer reports issue
|
+-- [Return / Dispute] initiated
+-- Evidence collected (photo/video/description)
+-- Root cause assigned
+-- Decision: Reject / Replace / Refund / Credit Note
+-- Reverse logistics (if needed)
+-- Financial settlement
+-- Score update (buyer/supplier/operator)
+-- Case closed
```

