# 9. MULTILINGUAL IA STRATEGY

## Language Priority

- **Phase 1:** Hindi-English Mixed (Hinglish)
- **Phase 2:** Bhojpuri, Maithili (Bihar-specific)
- **Phase 3:** Bengali, Marathi, Gujarati
- **Phase 4:** Full regional language support

## Label Examples

| English | Hindi-English | Context |
|---|---|---|
| Search | "Search karein" | Search bar |
| Order | "Order" | Button |
| Request Quote | "Rate mangayein" | Button |
| Delivered | "Pohunch gaya" | Status |
| In Stock | "Stock mein hai" | Status |
| Out of Stock | "Stock khatam" | Status |
| Payment Due | "Baki payment" | Status |
| Reorder | "Phir se order karein" | Button |

## Voice-First IA

Where voice input is useful:
- WhatsApp voice note to order creation
- Search by voice (textile colors, vehicle models)
- Issue reporting by voice
- Support call by voice

---

# 10. WHATSAPP-INTEGRATED IA

## WhatsApp as Parallel Channel

- Every buyer order gets WhatsApp confirmation
- Product updates sent via WhatsApp
- Delivery tracking sent via WhatsApp
- Payment reminders via WhatsApp
- Support fallback via WhatsApp

## WhatsApp to App Bridge

```
Buyer sends photo on WhatsApp
-> Support/AI captures product info
-> Creates structured request/order
-> Sends app link to confirm
-> Buyer opens app -> confirms -> order created
```

## Fallback Strategy

If app fails:
- WhatsApp continues working
- Phone support available
- Manual order entry by admin
- No business loss

